WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.491
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Lily. Welcome to Debate!

2
00:00:04.791 --> 00:00:06.967
Hi! I'm Malis!

3
00:00:07.267 --> 00:00:09.383
Today's topic is Accessories.

4
00:00:10.383 --> 00:00:16.553
Today we practise giving our ideas. There is no wrong answer, but we must say why.

5
00:00:17.550 --> 00:00:18.644
Necklace!

6
00:00:19.544 --> 00:00:21.860
Necklace. Your turn!

7
00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.179
Necklace!

8
00:00:26.479 --> 00:00:27.457
Great!

9
00:00:28.450 --> 00:00:29.428
Bracelet!

10
00:00:30.328 --> 00:00:32.841
Bracelet. Your turn!

11
00:00:35.741 --> 00:00:37.009
Bracelet!

12
00:00:37.309 --> 00:00:38.310
Wonderful!

13
00:00:39.317 --> 00:00:40.318
Watch!

14
00:00:41.218 --> 00:00:43.371
Watch. Your turn!

15
00:00:46.271 --> 00:00:47.353
Watch!

16
00:00:47.653 --> 00:00:48.770
Super!

17
00:00:49.783 --> 00:00:50.436
Belt!

18
00:00:51.336 --> 00:00:52.932
Belt. Your turn!

19
00:00:55.832 --> 00:00:56.694
Belt!

20
00:00:56.994 --> 00:00:58.169
Excellent!

21
00:00:59.183 --> 00:01:02.379
Which do you like better, Necklace or Bracelet?

22
00:01:06.179 --> 00:01:08.747
I like Necklace because it is fun.

23
00:01:09.047 --> 00:01:10.013
Good reason!

24
00:01:11.017 --> 00:01:14.157
Use because to give a reason. For example:

25
00:01:14.457 --> 00:01:17.002
I like Bracelet because it is nice.

26
00:01:17.802 --> 00:01:19.047
Your turn!

27
00:01:23.347 --> 00:01:25.915
I like Bracelet because it is nice.

28
00:01:26.917 --> 00:01:29.941
I think Necklace is fun. Do you agree?

29
00:01:33.741 --> 00:01:35.148
Yes, I agree!

30
00:01:35.448 --> 00:01:39.424
Be kind when you disagree. Say: I think differently.

31
00:01:40.417 --> 00:01:44.465
Listen to your friends. Take turns. Be polite.

32
00:01:44.765 --> 00:01:46.648
I will try, Ms. Lily!

33
00:01:47.650 --> 00:01:53.254
Great job today, everyone! See you next time. Bye-bye!

34
00:01:53.554 --> 00:01:54.996
Bye-bye!

